Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.41,0:09:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,STOP. STOP.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,did you spare my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.30,0:11:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Gabriel...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.42,0:24:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I want him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.09,0:25:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.84,0:25:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's how he spoke to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.61,0:26:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It will change you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.50,0:56:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We must make a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.87,0:57:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Russians\Nhave nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.05,1:17:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.05,1:17:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.39,1:17:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.06,1:17:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I will see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.36,1:17:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Go with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.16,1:22:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sending the coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.74,1:22:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Our people are listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.28,1:22:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The roof is collapsing. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.46,1:53:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we kill it?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.28,1:53:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.32,1:53:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...there's always a but.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.07,1:55:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.33,2:01:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Gabriel is down there.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.29,2:01:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me come with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.71,2:01:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,His time will come.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:14.05,2:12:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will live\Nand who will die?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.73,2:12:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will see you again.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:55.09,2:14:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I kill people.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.85,2:15:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to operate on me.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:11.10,2:15:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Close it tight.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.31,2:15:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A bandage.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.52,2:15:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A bandage please.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:17.88,2:16:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My clavicle... count down to my second rib.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.80,2:16:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,2:16:24.51,2:16:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...make an incision.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:33.52,2:16:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.52,2:16:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be OK.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.19,2:16:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Bottoms up.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:49.45,2:16:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.49,2:16:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pen... in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.58,2:16:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pressure.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.16,2:16:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it apart.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:01.63,2:17:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:16.31,2:17:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:36.55,2:31:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The blink of an eye.
